ta, request deletion of your account and data, opt out of marketing communications, and port your data. Exercise these rights by emailing privacy@consciousindi.com.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin:28px 0 10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm);">Cookies</h2><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 8px;">We use essential cookies (required for platform function), analytics cookies (to understand usage, opt-out available), and marketing cookies (personalised ads, opt-out available in cookie settings). See our <a href="/conscious/cookie-policy" style="color:var(--saffron-dark);">Cookie Policy</a>.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin:28px 0 10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm);">Data Security</h2><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 8px;">All data is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest. Payment data is processed by PCI-DSS compliant Razorpay — we do not store card numbers. We conduct regular security audits and penetration tests.</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-primary);margin:28px 0 10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-warm);">Contact</h2><p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 8px;">Data Protection Officer: privacy@consciousindi.com | Postal: Conscious India Pvt. Ltd., 3rd Floor, IndiQube Sigma, HSR Layout, Bengaluru — 560 102.</p>
